Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 05:25:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add field-dealer detail screen (account-like view + admin
 visibility)

Tapping a field-added dealer from My Dealers or My Visits previously
jumped straight to the Check-In tab with no way to see what was
entered. Adds a lightweight detail screen (not the full DealerDetail
CRM, since these leads have no ledger/orders yet) showing owner name,
WhatsApp/alternate numbers, address, GST registration, location on a
map, and the rep's own visit history there, with a shortcut into
Check In.

New get_field_dealer_detail() RPC, scoped to the adding rep or admin.

